      <rules>
        <rule name="Grunt Assault Ship" id="354e-f7b7-d8d0-065c" hidden="false">
          <description>Grunt assault ships embark huge crews of Ork boarding parties and are equipped with tractor fields, powerful boarding drills, etc. They roll 2D6 against an opposing ship when ramming and count as 2Hp when determining their boarding value (before other modifiers). These ships are equipped with a Traktor Field and must be mounted on a large base, and due to their poorly distributed mass cannot use Come To New Heading special orders. Grunt assault ships can be equipped with Klaws for +5 points each vessel, not per skwadron.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
